    "skyPreset": "golden_alpine_meadow",
    "loreSummary": "The only forest anybody has walked on Driftholt. Three more stands are drawn on the island and every one of them is reported ground; this is the one a crew can put an axe into. Under the wood the bogs go three deep, so the same ground gives the timber and the fuel to season it \u2014 and the island's single village stands here, which is why the wood comes out of this region and no other."
  },
